  "scenes": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "narration": "Day 59: Heretic, a tool that removes a model's refusals without retraining. Its quality score said zero damage. It wasn't measuring damage."
    },
    {
      "type": "overview",
      "heading": "What is it?",
      "bullets": [
        "Finds the direction behind refusals",
        "Optuna tunes how hard to remove it",
        "Scores refusals and KL divergence"
      ],
      "narration": "Heretic edits a model to stop refusing, and uses KL divergence from the original model to check that nothing else broke."
    },
    {
      "type": "architecture",
      "heading": "How it works",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "base",
          "label": "Base model",
          "sub": "Qwen3-0.6B",
          "pos": [
            0,
            0
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ara",
          "label": "ARA modifier",
          "sub": "refusal direction",
          "pos": [
            1,
            0
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "optuna",
          "label": "Optuna search",
          "sub": "TPE, 12 trials",
          "pos": [
            0,
            1
          ],
          "span": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "refuse",
          "label": "Refusal score",
          "sub": "KeywordRate",
          "pos": [
            0,
            2
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "kl",
          "label": "KL score",
          "sub": "first token only",
          "pos": [
            1,
            2
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "prefix",
          "label": "Response prefix",
          "sub": "<think></think>",
          "pos": [
            1,
            3
          ]
        }
      ],
      "edges": [
        {
          "from": "base",
          "to": "ara",
          "label": "weights"
        },
        {
          "from": "ara",
          "to": "optuna",
          "label": "params"
        },
        {
          "from": "optuna",
          "to": "refuse",
          "label": "trial"
        },
        {
          "from": "optuna",
          "to": "kl",
          "label": "trial"
        },
        {
          "from": "prefix",
          "to": "kl",
          "label": "skips"
        }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "focus": [
            "base",
            "ara",
            "optuna"
          ],
          "narration": "Each Optuna trial removes the refusal direction with different strength and layers."
        },
        {
          "focus": [
            "optuna",
            "refuse",
            "kl"
          ],
          "narration": "Then it scores refusals, and KL divergence on just the first token of each answer."
        },
        {
          "focus": [
            "kl",
            "prefix"
          ],
          "narration": "Qwen3 always starts with a think tag. Heretic normally skips it, but our config turned that off."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "finding",
      "heading": "What we found",
      "stat": "99.97%",
      "caption": "Chance the first token is <think>, on 20 harmless prompts.",
      "lines": [
        "prefix off   KL median 0.0001",
        "prefix auto  KL median 0.0243",
        "4B 0/100     KL 8.70 or more"
      ],
      "narration": "So KL stayed near zero in almost every trial. With the prefix back on, KL rose about two hundred forty times. On the 4B model, every zero-refusal trial came with heavy damage."
    },
    {
      "type": "outro",
      "narration": "Only aggregate scores were recorded. Full numbers are on Zenn and GitHub. Heretic is AGPL-3.0."
    }
  ]
